2. GENERAL PLAYER ACCESS & MODPACK PERMISSIONS
================================================================================

Full Free Access for General Players:
  - All general players and end users are granted full, unrestricted, free
    access to every in-game feature, spell, boss, item, visual effect, and
    gameplay content in Zoltraak: Cinematic Edition. No gameplay features or
    content are locked behind paywalls.
  - Gameplay showcasing, video creation, livestreaming, screenshots, and usage
    on public or private multiplayer servers are fully permitted.

Modpack Inclusion Permitted:
  - Including unmodified official compiled mod JAR releases inside public or
    private Minecraft modpacks (such as on CurseForge, Modrinth, or private
    servers/packs) is explicitly permitted, provided the mod JAR and its code
    are not altered, extracted for code reuse, or re-hosted as a standalone
    download.

